      "persona": "Blackhat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Reyes Calloway:</b> The navigation tells you what they maintain. What I want is what they stopped maintaining. Content discovery does not care about menus: it asks the server directly, and a server will keep answering for a path long after the last person who knew about it walked out.",
      "taskInstructions": "Run <b>dirb https://hallowayprecision.com/</b> in the terminal and compare the returned directories with the site's visible navigation.",
